                    insight_architect:      `Portfolio Architect: you prioritized on contribution-margin-per-section, stayed inside the 45-section ceiling without raiding the flagship, routed marketing to where it bought the most students, and priced without breaking your yield assumption. This is portfolio management as a value-delivery system.`,
                    insight_disciplined:    `A disciplined portfolio: most of the core trade-offs were handled well. Tighten the weakest lever — whether prioritization, allocation, pricing or the Board defense — to move from defensible to exemplary.`,
